Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:17.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦A梦电影30周年纪念作品
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.58,0:02:35.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这颗星球上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.42,0:02:37.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}连个象样的生物都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.43,0:02:47.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我们撤退吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.71,0:03:04.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}对不起，布依金大人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.32,0:03:07.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}在这颗星球上也没有发现他们
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.12,0:03:08.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}托拉吉斯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.15,0:03:09.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}布依金大人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.12,0:03:11.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}继续找
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.42,0:03:13.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}无论如何都要把他们找出来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.26,0:03:14.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}遵命
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.26,0:03:16.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那下个目标是哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.13,0:03:20.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是，太阳系的第三颗行星
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.40,0:03:24.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}也就是叫做地球的那颗行星
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.83,0:03:53.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.20,0:03:55.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}妈妈要你帮她去买东西啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.74,0:03:58.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄，妈妈…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.37,0:04:01.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我现在很忙啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.21,0:04:03.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}快要赶不上玩海盗游戏了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.51,0:04:05.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好痛…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.85,0:04:06.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.05,0:04:08.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}对不起啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.68,0:04:10.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}什么海盗游戏啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.25,0:04:12.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好像是跟胖虎他们先约好了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.82,0:04:15.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那就用温暖的眼神…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.76,0:04:16.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}守护他好了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.02,0:04:19.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}从学校放假之后就只知道玩耍
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.56,0:04:20.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这也证明大雄很健康
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.03,0:04:22.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}没什么关系啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.33,0:04:24.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}爸爸，你又说这种话
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.53,0:04:25.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}他都五年级了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.87,0:04:27.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}还跟个小孩子一样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.47,0:04:29.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真是令人操心
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.17,0:04:31.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}小孩子就该有点孩子气才好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.37,0:04:33.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦A梦，我说的对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.34,0:04:34.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}没错
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.74,0:04:36.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}既然这样的话
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.58,0:04:39.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那谁要替大雄去帮我买东西呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.05,0:04:41.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.18,0:04:42.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不行…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.38,0:04:44.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我跟小咪还要去约会
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.65,0:04:46.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那爸爸你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.95,0:04:48.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.12,0:04:50.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我…我也和田中先生约好了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.59,0:04:51.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}拜托啦，哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.96,0:04:54.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我这边是非常重要的约会
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.23,0:04:55.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.33,0:04:56.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}拜托啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.60,0:04:58.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}很重要的…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.64,0:05:04.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}两块油豆腐，四块竹荚鱼干
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.77,0:05:07.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}培根，鸡蛋，还有爸爸的啤酒
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.11,0:05:09.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}还有哆啦A梦的铜锣烧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.01,0:05:12.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我最喜欢妈妈了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.82,0:05:16.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好漂亮哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.25,0:05:18.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这是在帛琉岛拍的照片
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.42,0:05:21.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}前天我还和表哥在那里潜水哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.13,0:05:27.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}胖虎，你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.30,0:05:32.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这个破东西还真是难用耶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.20,0:05:34.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}蛙鞋本来就应该是在水里用的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.50,0:05:36.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嫌弃的话就快点还给我啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.84,0:05:39.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不过，小夫你刚才说的帛琉夫
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.41,0:05:41.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你表哥的名字还真奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.58,0:05:44.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不是帛琉夫啦，我说的是帛琉岛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.35,0:05:46.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}算了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.32,0:05:47.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}像你这种小学五年级
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.85,0:05:49.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}还在玩海盗游戏的人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.59,0:05:51.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎么可能会了解这种事呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.69,0:05:53.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是真的吗，胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.39,0:05:57.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}因为大雄一直说他很想玩嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.73,0:05:58.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}话说回来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.53,0:06:00.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你那个叫帛琉岛的表哥怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.63,0:06:03.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那是南太平洋上的一个岛国
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.13,0:06:04.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}到处可以看到
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.10,0:06:07.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}一望无际的清澈海水哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.74,0:06:10.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你们在看什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.47,0:06:11.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}快看，这张
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.04,0:06:13.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}快让我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.21,0:06:14.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好棒哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.31,0:06:15.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哪里…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.51,0:06:18.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这叫蝠鲼鱼，又被称作魔鬼鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.72,0:06:21.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这是小夫吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.32,0:06:23.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}被你发现了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.02,0:06:25.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你都不害怕吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.52,0:06:28.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}一点都不害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.17,0:06:36.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}静香也可以骑哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.67,0:06:39.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}下次一起去骑吧，怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.57,0:06:42.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我看还是不要好了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.04,0:06:45.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是哦，真的很好玩的说
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.24,0:06:46.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哪里…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.11,0:06:49.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}还有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.41,0:06:51.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这是我表哥在爱琴海潜水的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.62,0:06:53.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}拍的照片
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.45,0:06:58.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}妳看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.19,0:07:00.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这是沉在海底的遗迹
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.39,0:07:01.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好漂亮哦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.16,0:07:03.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我要看，我也要看
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.50,0:07:06.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}还想要看更多的话就来我家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.83,0:07:08.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我都拍成影像了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.20,0:07:10.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好耶，那就走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.24,0:07:11.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好期待哦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.10,0:07:14.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}走吧，一起去
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.31,0:07:16.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄也要来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.34,0:07:18.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不用勉强也没关系哦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.81,0:07:21.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你不是还要忙着玩海盗游戏吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.88,0:07:24.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}他是很忙啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.55,0:07:27.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是胖虎他叫我出来玩海盗游戏的耶　你们…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.06,0:07:29.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.09,0:07:31.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我怎么可能会玩那种
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.42,0:07:34.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}小孩子气的海盗游戏咧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.13,0:07:38.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}还有这个
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.17,0:07:41.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这是什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.17,0:07:43.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我找了老半天只找到这个
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.77,0:07:45.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这个连现在的幼儿园小孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.67,0:07:47.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}都不玩了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.41,0:07:50.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这是我上幼儿园的时候在玩的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.61,0:07:54.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}果然还是个小孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.15,0:07:55.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真像大雄的风格
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.42,0:07:58.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}静香妳…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.99,0:08:04.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}被我弄扁了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.36,0:08:07.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄，还给你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.69,0:08:09.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好了，我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.20,0:08:11.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄不来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.67,0:08:13.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}他想来的话自己会来的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.00,0:08:14.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}说得没错
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.04,0:08:16.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄都已经五年级了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.64,0:08:18.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}应该可以自己做决定了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.47,0:08:21.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我忘了，他还在念幼儿园啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.84,0:08:25.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你们不要这样说大雄啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.45,0:08:27.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.38,0:08:30.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}太欺负人了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.62,0:08:35.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.06,0:08:38.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.19,0:08:39.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.23,0:08:41.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不行，我得要用…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.40,0:08:45.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}最温暖的眼神来守护着他
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.13,0:08:47.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.34,0:08:49.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我来了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.51,0:08:58.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦A梦：大雄的人鱼大海战
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.85,0:09:05.52,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200))}片头曲「蓝色梦想」
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.76,0:09:11.29,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200))}有个充满希望圆滚滚的模样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.46,0:09:15.30,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200))}蓝色的梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.47,0:09:19.07,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200))}总是带领我们乘着梦的翅膀
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.24,0:09:21.30,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200))}自由的飞翔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.47,0:09:23.17,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200))}竹蜻蜓！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.34,0:09:26.88,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200))}穿过每个时空越过宇宙两端
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.04,0:09:30.38,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200))}多不可思议的梦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.55,0:09:32.72,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200))}只要推开红色的门
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.88,0:09:36.82,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200))}所有心愿就可以实现啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.02,0:09:38.82,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200))}任意门！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.02,0:09:42.63,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200))}长大后就忘了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.79,0:09:46.53,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200))}曾经拥有过的梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.70,0:09:50.37,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200))}让我们来手牵手
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.53,0:09:54.34,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200))}一起出发去冒险啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.51,0:09:58.31,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200))}夏啦啦啦啦　让我们手拉着手
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.48,0:10:02.21,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200))}转着圈圈哼唱着快乐的歌
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.38,0:10:05.08,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200))}哆啦A梦用你的口袋
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.25,0:10:09.15,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200))}变化出未来的幸福吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.12,0:10:13.93,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200))}夏啦啦啦啦　让我们手拉着手
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.09,0:10:17.80,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200))}飞向天空享受着吹来的风
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.96,0:10:20.60,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200))}哆啦A梦是你的出现
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.77,0:10:27.64,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200))}让世界充满希望和梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.51,0:10:34.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦A梦，我也好想去潜水哦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.65,0:10:36.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好痛…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.05,0:10:39.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大…大雄，戴上这个
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.05,0:10:41.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.29,0:10:44.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}虚构海水触觉眼镜
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.69,0:10:46.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你不是想去潜水吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.39,0:10:48.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}太好了，要去哪里潜水
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.86,0:10:50.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}去帛琉，还是夏威夷
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.23,0:10:52.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.20,0:10:55.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}在这里，在这间屋子里
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.43,0:10:58.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}对啊，快点，戴上眼镜吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.11,0:11:02.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}虚构海水触觉眼镜
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.91,0:11:05.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}感觉好像在骗人哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.65,0:11:11.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你…你在干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.65,0:11:12.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}等等
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.79,0:11:15.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}快点停下来，妈妈会骂人的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.06,0:11:17.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你摘下眼镜来看一看
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.28,0:11:44.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这是怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.35,0:11:47.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这是一台虚构水面仿真器水泵
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.66,0:11:48.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}虚构水面
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.92,0:11:49.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}没错
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.66,0:11:50.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}为了研究及预测
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.86,0:11:52.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}地球海平面上升所引发的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.99,0:11:54.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}而开发出来的假海水
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.96,0:11:56.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}假海水
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.23,0:11:57.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.33,0:12:00.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}没有戴眼镜的人是不会看到水的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.30,0:12:02.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}而且也不会弄湿
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.04,0:12:04.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好神奇哦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.31,0:12:05.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}只要把这些水存起来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.04,0:12:08.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}对啊，就能把这一带变成海底
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.81,0:12:11.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这样就能享受潜水的乐趣了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.75,0:12:13.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.08,0:12:15.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}也让我试试看
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.25,0:12:16.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.25,0:12:18.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.05,0:12:19.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}用这台水泵
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.86,0:12:22.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}要花多久时间才能存够水啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.46,0:12:24.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大概要到今天晚上
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.86,0:12:27.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我可撑不了那么久啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.23,0:12:31.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}奇怪，还在动耶
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.23,0:12:33.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就算你不管它还是照样会动的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.07,0:12:36.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那你怎么不早点说，真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.44,0:12:39.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}还有其它要准备的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.78,0:12:41.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}等等我啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.41,0:12:43.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}要去哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.31,0:12:45.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}要运送鱼过来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.85,0:12:46.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}还不懂吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.88,0:12:50.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}要拍出让小夫目瞪口呆的照片啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.19,0:12:53.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}太感谢你了，哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.53,0:12:59.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}鱼儿最爱吃的鱼饵
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.06,0:13:03.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄，把这个鱼饵洒在附近
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.37,0:13:04.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}撒了以后会怎么样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.07,0:13:07.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}鱼儿们就会聚集过来吃啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.37,0:13:08.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你说鱼儿
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.94,0:13:13.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}从天上飞到这里来吃吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.34,0:13:14.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}没错
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.05,0:13:16.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好，开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.72,0:13:26.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}最后再用这个
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.63,0:13:30.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}活动钓鱼池
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.86,0:13:35.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}调整好刻度之后
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.87,0:13:45.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}变成海洋了，这里会有鱼吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.95,0:13:47.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}有耶
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.81,0:13:50.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这可是跟真的大海连在一起的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.18,0:13:53.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}接下来…虚构海水连带气体
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.69,0:13:55.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}鱼儿们只要接触了这种气体
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.09,0:13:59.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就能够在模拟海水中生存了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.16,0:14:02.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好了，再来等到晚上就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.53,0:14:04.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真令人期待
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.41,0:14:47.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}找到了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.45,0:14:56.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}比对不一致
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.75,0:15:00.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}又是一把普通的破烂剑啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.72,0:15:01.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}破坏它
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.79,0:15:02.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}遵命
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.86,0:15:09.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}托拉吉斯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.13,0:15:11.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}布依金大人，实在很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.03,0:15:13.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我一定会赌上我的性命
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.73,0:15:14.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}找出人鱼族
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.87,0:15:17.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}并且将宝剑得手的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.94,0:15:21.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}话说回来，托拉吉斯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.38,0:15:22.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你以前有没有看过
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.04,0:15:25.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}水量如此丰沛的行星
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.71,0:15:27.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}从来没有
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.18,0:15:29.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这真是一颗美丽的行星
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.18,0:15:30.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}对那些人鱼来说
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.72,0:15:33.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这里是再适合不过的藏身之处
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.35,0:15:34.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}无论用什么方法
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.69,0:15:36.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}都要把他们找出来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.29,0:15:37.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}遵命
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.96,0:15:41.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄，时间差不多啰
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.83,0:15:48.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}什么嘛，都没有看到有积水啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.97,0:15:50.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你戴上这个
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.28,0:15:58.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄，快点穿上这个
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.38,0:15:59.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}旱鸭子专用蛙鞋
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.02,0:16:01.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}穿上它就会游泳了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.69,0:16:03.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}都这么晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.05,0:16:05.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}爸爸今天还真晚耶
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.29,0:16:13.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.10,0:16:15.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄，不能碰那个
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.10,0:16:18.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}糟…糟糕了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.60,0:16:22.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}救命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.58,0:16:29.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄，你怎么还没睡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.95,0:16:31.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}快点睡觉了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.45,0:16:36.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦A梦，快想想办法
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.12,0:16:39.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}还…还差一点点
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.90,0:16:47.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.27,0:16:50.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}吓死人了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.63,0:16:51.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}刚才那是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.10,0:16:52.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.97,0:16:55.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你把水泵的安全装置解除了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.67,0:16:58.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}当你戴着虚构海水触觉眼镜的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.51,0:17:01.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是绝对不能去碰那个按钮的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.65,0:17:06.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哇塞，街道都淹没在海底了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.62,0:17:15.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄，那里是虚构水面哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.76,0:17:21.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}整个城镇都变成大海了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.03,0:17:23.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不止整个城镇
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.30,0:17:24.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}全世界都变这样了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.87,0:17:26.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}太厉害了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.94,0:17:30.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.63,0:17:49.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那个是…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.06,0:17:51.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄，你在看什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.06,0:17:54.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}刚…刚才有一条人鱼跳出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.80,0:17:57.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}人鱼，这怎么可能嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.70,0:18:00.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我刚才明明就看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.27,0:18:01.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}要不要拍照
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.38,0:18:06.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}来，笑一个
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.29,0:18:13.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}什么声音
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.52,0:18:16.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}过去看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.44,0:18:35.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}鲨…鲨鱼，有鲨鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.08,0:18:37.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好，你先冷静一下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.05,0:18:40.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}街道上怎么会有鲨鱼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.31,0:18:42.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我刚刚就看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.52,0:18:43.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}在香烟店的转角那里
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.92,0:18:46.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}呼啦一下就游了过去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.85,0:18:49.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}呼啦一下的是在说你自己吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.39,0:18:50.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你是不是喝醉了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.06,0:18:53.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我那时候正跟田中先生聊天
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.86,0:18:55.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}快点回家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.43,0:18:57.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不然会被你老婆骂的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.07,0:19:00.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我真的看到了，亲眼看到的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.84,0:19:03.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好，快点回去吧，路上小心哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.40,0:19:06.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}鲨鱼真的在空中游动耶
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.51,0:19:10.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你看，还有沙丁鱼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.16,0:19:24.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}看来，真的是我喝多了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.56,0:19:27.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.53,0:19:29.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄，你刚刚看到的是…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.93,0:19:31.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不是人鱼，难道是…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.70,0:19:32.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}鲨鱼…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.04,0:19:33.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.74,0:19:36.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}得快点捉起来送回海里去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.77,0:19:38.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.91,0:19:41.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}爸爸怎么可能会看得到鲨鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.38,0:19:42.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}他又没戴眼镜
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.81,0:19:44.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你把眼镜摘掉看看
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.05,0:19:46.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.55,0:19:48.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.22,0:19:49.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄，你看
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.92,0:19:51.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}虽然看不到虚构水
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.45,0:19:53.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}还是照样能够看得到鱼吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.29,0:19:54.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}因为这眼镜
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.12,0:19:56.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是专门用来看虚构水的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.29,0:19:57.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}爸爸没有戴眼镜
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.43,0:19:59.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}却能看得到鱼儿是因为
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.23,0:20:01.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}虚构海水连带气体的关系
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.90,0:20:04.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}鱼儿在虚构水中也能够生存了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.87,0:20:05.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.14,0:20:08.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那我们分两边去找鲨鱼吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.64,0:20:09.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.88,0:20:17.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是我眼花了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.99,0:20:24.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.36,0:20:57.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}找不到耶
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.66,0:21:01.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}鲨鱼这家伙跑去哪里了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.57,0:21:10.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄，你后面
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.97,0:21:15.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}救命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.77,0:21:17.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我找…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.31,0:21:19.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}回家八音盒
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.45,0:21:21.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}来这边
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.08,0:21:24.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我才不怕你呢，有本事就过来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.73,0:21:36.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}只要听了这个八音盒的旋律
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.80,0:21:39.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不管在哪里都会想要立刻回家
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.34,0:21:53.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这样所有的鱼儿都回到海里了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.72,0:21:57.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我们现在也该回家了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.79,0:22:00.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是啊，我想睡觉了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.06,0:22:08.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}晚安，哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.06,0:22:10.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.38,0:22:23.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好像快要下雨了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.41,0:22:25.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄，我要开始冲洗照片啰
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.98,0:22:27.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.49,0:22:35.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}什么东西啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.83,0:22:45.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我的妈呀
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.77,0:22:46.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.87,0:22:51.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那…那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.51,0:22:56.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}看…看到了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.98,0:23:01.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}难道是昨天晚上的鲨鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.68,0:23:02.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}鲨鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.92,0:23:05.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我看到的明明是女孩子耶
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.13,0:23:15.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好可爱哦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.07,0:23:17.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可是奇怪了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.60,0:23:20.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我刚才明明有看到鱼尾鳍
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.41,0:23:32.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好帅气唷
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.55,0:23:37.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好可爱的妹妹啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.29,0:23:39.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}她是你新认识的朋友吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.66,0:23:42.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄，快点请她进来坐坐
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.43,0:23:48.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}她好像很渴的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.67,0:23:54.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}她在说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.20,0:23:55.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}听不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.27,0:23:57.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是不是还想再喝一杯果汁
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.35,0:24:02.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.32,0:24:10.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}翻译蒟蒻
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.82,0:24:14.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}出太阳了，那就来洗衣服吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.53,0:24:15.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那…那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.06,0:24:18.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这是什么东西，难道是一种河豚
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.80,0:24:20.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}河豚
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.83,0:24:23.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不好意思，我是猫
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.54,0:24:24.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你是猫
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.07,0:24:26.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你要笑到什么时候
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.97,0:24:28.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}对不起…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.94,0:24:31.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我叫做大雄，这位是…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.41,0:24:33.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我是叫做哆啦A梦的猫
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.58,0:24:36.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我是…苏菲亚
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.12,0:24:44.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我才没有骗人咧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.46,0:24:46.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是我妈妈听人家说的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.56,0:24:48.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}昨天晚上街上出现了鲨鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.86,0:24:50.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}胡说，又不是在海里
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.70,0:24:53.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}在街上怎么可能会有鲨鱼嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.33,0:24:56.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我听说看到鲨鱼的人是小杉哦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.24,0:24:57.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.11,0:25:01.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎么可能啦，又不是大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.04,0:25:03.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}叫我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.88,0:25:05.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我又怎么了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.89,0:25:15.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.86,0:25:18.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄，这个女孩子是谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.26,0:25:20.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我来介绍一下，这是苏菲亚
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.66,0:25:23.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我现在正在带她参观附近的街道
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.13,0:25:23.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这位是…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.06,0:25:25.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄的知心朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.27,0:25:27.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我叫胖虎，本名叫刚田武
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.70,0:25:29.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我是小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.94,0:25:32.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我叫静香，初次见面
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.21,0:25:34.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}苏菲亚，妳是从哪里来的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.74,0:25:36.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}她从哪里来的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.62,0:25:44.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}什么嘛，不过就是架飞机
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.19,0:25:46.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}在天上…游泳
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.55,0:25:50.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}游泳，这个说法还真有趣耶
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.76,0:25:53.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}苏菲亚，妳不会没有见过飞机吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.66,0:25:55.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎么可能，都什么时代了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.10,0:25:58.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可见她从小住在乡下
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.57,0:26:01.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你说话的口气太让人讨厌
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.84,0:26:03.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}又很失礼
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.51,0:26:06.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好啦！\N快点带苏菲亚到街上去逛一逛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.91,0:26:08.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}没气了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.34,0:26:08.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}往那里看
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.04,0:26:11.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}在阴天的时候就能看到好多云
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.51,0:26:13.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}还有，从这地方下去的话
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.28,0:26:14.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可以看到好多…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.78,0:26:16.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}沿着这条路一直走
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.56,0:26:24.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}等一下啦
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.69,0:26:27.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}奇怪，苏菲亚呢
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.80,0:26:31.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}苏菲亚，危险
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.87,0:26:37.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}太危险啦
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.17,0:26:39.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真是的，太不象话了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.24,0:26:40.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.91,0:26:44.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}苏菲亚，要遵守交通规则啦
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.48,0:26:45.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这个是…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.45,0:26:47.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}什么，这是竹蜻蜓啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.88,0:26:50.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}有这个就能在天上游泳了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.29,0:26:52.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.40,0:27:07.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}苏菲亚，速度太快了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.17,0:27:09.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真不敢相信
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.51,0:27:12.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我居然能在天上游泳
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.33,0:27:33.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}苏菲亚
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.06,0:27:35.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎么办…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.97,0:27:36.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}水
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.60,0:27:37.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}什么
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.37,0:27:40.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}拜托，我想回到水里去
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.91,0:27:41.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.47,0:27:44.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦A梦，快点带她到我家去
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.68,0:27:45.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.94,0:27:47.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}任意门
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.28,0:27:52.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}来，往这边走
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.92,0:27:54.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}再忍耐一下
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.82,0:27:56.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}苏菲亚
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.16,0:28:00.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我现在就让妳泡澡
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.80,0:28:06.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大家都出去啦
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.30,0:28:07.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.60,0:28:09.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄你也出去
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.20,0:28:10.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.40,0:28:13.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那个…我忘记收回任意门了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.64,0:28:14.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}快点啦
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.04,0:28:16.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.96,0:28:34.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}原来苏菲亚也喜欢泡澡
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.06,0:28:39.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.63,0:28:43.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄，你不觉得很奇怪吗
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.07,0:28:45.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}她居然连飞机和红绿灯
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.67,0:28:47.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}都没有看过
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.24,0:28:51.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}苏菲亚她…该不会是河童吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.11,0:28:54.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你在胡说些什么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.31,0:28:56.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可是她突然想泡澡也很怪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.42,0:28:57.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}所以你才说她是河童吗
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.12,0:28:58.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}对
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.82,0:28:59.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.89,0:29:02.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}人鱼存在吗
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.29,0:29:04.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}一下河童，现在又是人鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.22,0:29:05.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.39,0:29:09.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我第一次看到苏菲亚的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.63,0:29:12.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好像在她的脚上看到鱼尾鳍
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.20,0:29:13.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就像人鱼一样
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.04,0:29:19.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是这个啦
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.61,0:29:21.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是哆啦美打来的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.74,0:29:23.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}喂，妳好
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.11,0:29:24.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}喂，是哥哥吗
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.35,0:29:25.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}关于人鱼我调查过了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.08,0:29:27.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你现在在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.41,0:29:29.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就在静香的房间里
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.48,0:29:32.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}各位，我正好请哆啦美来帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.13,0:29:37.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.89,0:29:39.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}没…没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.56,0:29:43.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}关于人鱼的事情，妳知道些什么
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.13,0:29:47.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就交给最新型的时空电话吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.40,0:29:50.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄，你先画一下人鱼的图吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.91,0:29:52.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}画人鱼的图
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.78,0:29:56.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}最古老的人鱼传说
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.58,0:29:58.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}出现在公元前3千年
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.88,0:30:01.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}也就是5千年前的上古时代
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.55,0:30:02.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那么早以前就有了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.75,0:30:04.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}画好了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.66,0:30:13.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}所谓的人鱼总是被人们描绘成
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.83,0:30:17.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}上半身是人，下半身是鱼的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.43,0:30:19.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就像大雄画的图一样
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.87,0:30:21.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不过，你们看看这个
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.28,0:30:27.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这…这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.31,0:30:28.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是鱼吗
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.34,0:30:29.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不，是人类吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.78,0:30:31.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这是巴比伦神话中所记载
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.85,0:30:34.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}名为奥安尼斯的水神
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.42,0:30:36.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}据说他从海里现身
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.62,0:30:40.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}向住在陆地的人们传授文明
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.19,0:30:43.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可以说是人鱼的始祖哦
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.06,0:30:48.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}奥安尼斯作为保佑航海安全的神
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.47,0:30:50.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}受到人们的崇拜呢
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.37,0:30:51.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}除此之外
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.01,0:30:57.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}据说希腊神话中
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.57,0:30:59.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}出现的海神波赛顿
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.98,0:31:03.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}他儿子特里登也是人鱼的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.75,0:31:06.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}人鱼的传说世界上到处都有呢
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.55,0:31:08.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可是不是也有一种说法
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.45,0:31:09.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}有人把海里游的海牛
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.09,0:31:12.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}误认为是人鱼吗
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.73,0:31:16.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}看，这就是海牛
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.93,0:31:20.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这是什么，这一点也不像人鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.77,0:31:23.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}有人把哺乳中的海牛的模样
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.23,0:31:25.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}看成了人鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.37,0:31:27.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}看起来有像吗
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.68,0:31:33.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}苏菲亚，衣服我放在这里哦
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.28,0:31:34.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}什么
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.51,0:31:35.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这套洋装
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.51,0:31:37.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我想先洗一下会比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.12,0:31:39.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不行，不要乱碰
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.22,0:31:47.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那等我有新消息会再通知你们
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.63,0:31:49.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}谢谢妳，哆啦美
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.76,0:31:53.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}发生什么事了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.87,0:31:59.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}静香她…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.77,0:32:01.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}变成人鱼了…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.24,0:32:06.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}苏菲亚，这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.38,0:32:11.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}什么，妳是从海底过来的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.35,0:32:13.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}对，这套专用的衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.55,0:32:15.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可以让我们在大海里
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.19,0:32:17.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}自由自在的游泳
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.19,0:32:19.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真对不起，吓到妳了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.79,0:32:21.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}一开始有吓到
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.43,0:32:24.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不过能够变成人鱼也满好玩的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.93,0:32:26.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是吗，太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.97,0:32:27.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.10,0:32:30.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}因为虚构海水连带气体的作用
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.17,0:32:32.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}让她迷失在模拟海水中了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.97,0:32:35.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这么说，妳的家乡在海底啰
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.88,0:32:36.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}对
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.91,0:32:38.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}据说我们人鱼族的祖先
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.85,0:32:41.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}在5千年前来到了地球定居
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.55,0:32:43.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}并且建造了一座很大的城市
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.15,0:32:46.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}开始在海底的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.42,0:32:47.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你说来到了地球
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.12,0:32:50.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那么说的话是外星人啰
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.59,0:32:52.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}而且5千年前的说法
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.36,0:32:54.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}和人鱼的传说是一致的耶
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.76,0:32:57.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}对啊，也许就是人们在海上
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.36,0:32:59.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}看到了苏菲亚的祖先
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.17,0:33:02.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}所以世界各地才会有人鱼的传说
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.17,0:33:07.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可是，怎么会想要来地球呢
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.24,0:33:08.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}据说我们人鱼族
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.08,0:33:11.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}最早原本和平的生活在
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.28,0:33:13.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}与地球非常相似的一个星球
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.65,0:33:15.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}蓝水星上
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.09,0:33:18.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不过…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.43,0:33:27.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大海受到了污染
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.10,0:33:28.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那颗星球
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.00,0:33:31.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}变得不再适合生物居住了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.14,0:33:37.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}于是你们就到地球来了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.71,0:33:39.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}其实我们人鱼族
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.94,0:33:42.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是被禁止到陆地上来的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.64,0:33:45.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}但是我很想亲眼看看故乡的星星
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.78,0:33:48.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}所以才冒险从海底来到这里
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.65,0:33:53.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那我们现在就一起去看星星吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.19,0:33:58.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄，你在说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.63,0:34:00.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}星星只有晚上才看得到
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.56,0:34:01.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}没错…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.66,0:34:04.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}所以只要到夜里去就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.10,0:34:06.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}说的对耶
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.17,0:34:09.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}地球上总有处于夜晚的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.24,0:34:11.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}只要到那里去就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.91,0:34:13.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}想不到大雄满机零的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.91,0:34:17.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不过，要去哪里比较好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.21,0:34:19.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}现在是晚上的国家很多耶
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.45,0:34:23.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}苏菲亚，蓝水星在什么方位
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.25,0:34:25.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}对不起，我也不是很清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.72,0:34:27.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}但是根据传说
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.76,0:34:30.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}蓝水星与4个月亮连一线
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.23,0:34:32.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}会构成一个五角形哦
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.43,0:34:33.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}如果是五角形
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.70,0:34:35.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}有一个叫御夫座的星座很有名
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.97,0:34:37.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}五角形吗
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.54,0:34:38.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}饺子
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.67,0:34:40.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是御夫座啦
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.37,0:34:42.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}反正我们就到那里去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.74,0:34:44.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不过，御夫座是冬季的星座
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.01,0:34:47.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}日本现在根本看不到
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.25,0:34:48.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那南半球呢
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.88,0:34:50.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}现在正要入冬不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.78,0:34:51.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就是那里
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.12,0:34:55.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好，我们就往黑夜出发啰
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.26,0:35:01.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好冷哦
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.53,0:35:05.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}当然冷了，这里已经是冬天了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.33,0:35:09.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}太壮观了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.80,0:35:12.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}感觉就像星星正往我们靠近呢
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.17,0:35:13.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真的好漂亮哦
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.97,0:35:17.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}多么漂亮的星星
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.14,0:35:21.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}苏菲亚故乡的星星会是哪一颗呢
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.72,0:35:26.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这些星星当中一定会有蓝水星
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.73,0:35:42.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不过啊，小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.27,0:35:43.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哪一个是饺子呢
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.27,0:35:44.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就是那个五角形的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.54,0:35:45.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是御夫座啦
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.61,0:35:47.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}没错…就是那个
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.11,0:35:50.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是那颗吗，还是这颗呢
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.94,0:35:52.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我看看哦
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.21,0:35:53.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我也搞不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.41,0:35:54.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}什么
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.98,0:35:57.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}拜托，这里有这么多的星星
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.25,0:35:59.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}根本搞不清楚到底是哪一颗嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.05,0:36:01.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}倒是你们不冷吗
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.56,0:36:04.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}快点回去了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.79,0:36:07.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.39,0:36:09.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}站住，你别想跑
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.26,0:36:10.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你不要追过来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.63,0:36:12.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}站住…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.67,0:36:15.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我可不饶你，你给我站住
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.14,0:36:15.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.10,0:36:17.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你到底要我怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.97,0:36:21.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}小夫，你快点把饺子…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.18,0:36:22.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是御夫座啦
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.98,0:36:26.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}反正都怪你找不到那颗星星啦
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.61,0:36:29.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}苏菲亚她有多伤心，你知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.32,0:36:29.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}没错
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.12,0:36:31.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}对于苏菲亚来说
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.25,0:36:33.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那可是非常重要的星星呢
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.32,0:36:35.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}所以你一定要认真的对待
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.09,0:36:37.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就算是这样子
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.46,0:36:39.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}人家还是冷得要命
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.39,0:36:41.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是男子汉就要忍耐
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.36,0:36:42.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}对，要忍耐
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.83,0:36:44.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}忍耐啊，要忍耐
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.17,0:36:45.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}人家就是忍耐不了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.50,0:36:47.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}谢谢你们大家
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.34,0:36:48.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不过，没关系啦
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.84,0:36:49.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可是苏菲亚
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.80,0:36:52.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}妳不是要找故乡的星星
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.37,0:36:53.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我已经亲眼看到
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.91,0:36:55.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}很多美丽的星星啦
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.78,0:36:58.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我现在觉得非常的幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.82,0:37:01.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}小夫，谢谢你啦
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.05,0:37:04.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不客气
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.39,0:37:07.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我也该回去海底的宫殿了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.06,0:37:08.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.76,0:37:10.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}苏菲亚，妳住在宫殿里
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.06,0:37:11.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.86,0:37:14.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那么说妳是女王陛下啰
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.40,0:37:17.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不，我还没有正式继承王位呢
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.90,0:37:21.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}所以现在还是人鱼族的公主
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.67,0:37:25.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}公主…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.44,0:37:26.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}有找到吗
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.34,0:37:27.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}没有，都没有看到
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.08,0:37:31.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}公主…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.08,0:37:32.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.12,0:37:34.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}万一被地球人发现的话
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.72,0:37:36.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那就糟糕了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.85,0:37:38.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}还没有找到吗
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.49,0:37:39.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}到处都找遍了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.09,0:37:41.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大家快点分头去找
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.39,0:37:45.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}海底的宫殿一定很漂亮吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.43,0:37:48.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦A梦，我也好想去看看哦
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.23,0:37:50.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是一座在海底的宫殿耶
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.00,0:37:53.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}难道你们不想去看看吗
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.20,0:37:55.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是啊，我也好想去看
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.27,0:37:56.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.31,0:37:57.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那个…我也想
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.77,0:37:59.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}求求你啦，哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.98,0:38:02.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}苏菲亚，我们可以去吗
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.75,0:38:03.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}没问题啊
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.68,0:38:05.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我会好好招待大家的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.32,0:38:07.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}太好了，就这样决定
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.35,0:38:09.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}出发了，到海底宫殿去
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.55,0:38:10.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}走吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.39,0:38:12.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你们这些家伙，不要得意忘形了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.36,0:38:19.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你说什么，发现人鱼族了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.06,0:38:21.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.27,0:38:23.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}无论从什么角度看都是人鱼族
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.40,0:38:24.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}绝对不会错的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.84,0:38:26.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}托拉吉斯
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.57,0:38:29.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}干得好，继续监视
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.17,0:38:30.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}遵命
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.08,0:38:32.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}从前我的祖先
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.68,0:38:35.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}从人鱼族那里夺走了…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.48,0:38:41.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}传说中的盔甲
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.09,0:38:45.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}接下来只要找出人鱼之剑就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.32,0:38:48.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}只要得到了这个盔甲和传说之剑
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.99,0:38:52.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}整个宇宙就是我的囊中之物了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.94,0:39:06.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}把奇妙镜放大之后
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.85,0:39:13.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}颜色就这样调整好了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.42,0:39:16.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}苏菲亚，请妳站在镜子前面
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.46,0:39:17.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.63,0:39:22.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎么回事，哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.26,0:39:24.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真是的，你们别来捣乱啦
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.53,0:39:26.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}抱歉…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.20,0:39:32.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}做好一套了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.14,0:39:33.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}如果要去海底的话
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.64,0:39:34.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}有苏菲亚的人鱼套装
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.08,0:39:37.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}应该会比较方便
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.35,0:39:39.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这是什么魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.11,0:39:41.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}应该说是魔法吗
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.58,0:39:42.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}没有什么事情
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.52,0:39:44.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是哆啦A梦办不到的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.65,0:39:46.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}虽然常常会出差错就是了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.79,0:39:47.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}没错
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.12,0:39:48.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.86,0:39:51.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}快点换上衣服，准备要出发了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.00,0:40:03.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}适应灯
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.07,0:40:06.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这样不管在什么地方都不怕了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.64,0:40:09.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}海底也没问题吗
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.94,0:40:11.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}只要在24小时之内
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.95,0:40:15.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆…哆啦A梦，差不多可以了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.72,0:40:18.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.55,0:40:20.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好，我们出发吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.78,0:41:52.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这个是防水绳索
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.25,0:41:53.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}只要进入绳子圈的中间
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.15,0:41:56.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}水就不会靠近了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.13,0:42:06.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真是让人惊讶耶
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.57,0:42:07.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦A梦就像是
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.10,0:42:10.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}人鱼族传说中的海神玛娜提娅呢
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.70,0:42:12.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}传说中的海神
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.40,0:42:13.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}玛娜提娅
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.64,0:42:16.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}对啊，那是我奶奶告诉我的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.61,0:42:19.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}当人鱼族面临危险的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.01,0:42:24.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}他都会使用人鱼之剑来帮助我们
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.85,0:42:26.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}人鱼之剑
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.72,0:42:28.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}据说我们人鱼族的祖先们
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.12,0:42:30.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}世世代代都尽心尽力的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.96,0:42:33.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}守护着那把人鱼之剑
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.36,0:42:35.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}但是现在却不知去向了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.29,0:42:36.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}弄丢了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.00,0:42:39.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那是5千年前流传下来的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.73,0:42:40.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}也有人说
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.70,0:42:43.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那只不过是一个传说而已
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.20,0:42:45.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}传说之剑，好棒哦
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.81,0:42:47.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}听起来真是浪漫呢
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.87,0:42:48.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}对了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.81,0:42:49.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.61,0:42:51.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我们一起来找人鱼之剑吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.58,0:42:53.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你说什么，哪有这种…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.68,0:42:55.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这个你也能办到吗，哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.02,0:42:57.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这…这个
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.68,0:42:58.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}没问题啦
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.15,0:43:01.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}坐在你面前的可是哆啦提娅
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.26,0:43:04.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}比海神玛娜提娅还要更厉害哦
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.13,0:43:06.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}与其说是海神
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.96,0:43:08.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不如说是海狸猫吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.90,0:43:10.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}一点也没错
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.16,0:43:12.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我才不是什么狸猫呢
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.80,0:43:15.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好吧，既然如此
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.20,0:43:15.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不是这个…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.14,0:43:17.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不对…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.30,0:43:18.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这个也不是，不对…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.91,0:43:19.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.91,0:43:21.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.31,0:43:24.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}寻宝纸，还有显示暖炉
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.88,0:43:29.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}来，苏菲亚，妳拿着这个
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.65,0:43:30.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.78,0:43:31.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这又是什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.92,0:43:33.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}在寻找宝物的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.62,0:43:35.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}它会告诉我们一些线索哦
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.89,0:43:38.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}如果说人鱼之剑真的存在的话
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.39,0:43:39.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那么重要线索
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.53,0:43:41.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}肯定会显示出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.76,0:43:42.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}苏菲亚
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.13,0:43:44.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}试试看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.31,0:43:57.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}显示出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.51,0:44:00.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}当得到皇家真心祈祷之时
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.08,0:44:03.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}五色之光将会聚集
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.55,0:44:05.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}而愿望也得以实现
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.52,0:44:06.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这又是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.89,0:44:07.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}只要解开这个谜题
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.12,0:44:09.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就能找到宝剑了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.69,0:44:10.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}上面所说的皇家
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.89,0:44:12.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}会不会就是苏菲亚呢
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.23,0:44:15.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.67,0:44:21.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这个是…是蓝水星的古文字
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.30,0:44:24.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}上面写的是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.44,0:44:26.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这些文字实在太古老了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.41,0:44:27.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我也看不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.88,0:44:29.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}苏菲亚，照这么看来
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.41,0:44:32.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}人鱼之剑确实是存在的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.95,0:44:33.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}没错
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.68,0:44:34.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}只要能够解开这个谜题
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.12,0:44:36.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就一定可以找得到
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.79,0:44:46.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}五色之光，谜题
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.44,0:45:02.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}如果是奶奶的话
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.38,0:45:04.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}也许她会知道些什么
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.36,0:45:17.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}苏菲亚
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.53,0:45:20.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}早安，苏菲亚
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.10,0:45:22.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}早安，静香
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.67,0:45:25.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那个皇冠真的好漂亮哦
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.90,0:45:28.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这个是我们人鱼族皇家的标志
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.97,0:45:30.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}妳是说皇家
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.14,0:45:33.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真的好令人憧憬哦
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.65,0:45:36.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}静香，妳想要戴看看吗
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.58,0:45:38.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真的可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.68,0:45:39.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}让妳体验一下
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.12,0:45:42.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}当公主是什么样的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.95,0:45:45.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}谢谢妳，苏菲亚
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.73,0:45:51.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那个我帮妳拿吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.20,0:45:52.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.11,0:46:07.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}感觉好棒哦
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.52,0:46:15.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}早安
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.39,0:46:16.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}早安…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.09,0:46:21.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄，快点起床了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.16,0:46:22.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}要准备出发了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.80,0:46:27.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}快点起床，大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.74,0:46:30.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好壮观哦
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.14,0:46:33.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我们的宫殿就在这下面了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.84,0:46:34.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}出发吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.91,0:46:36.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.15,0:46:43.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.35,0:46:44.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我们潜入海底
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.62,0:46:46.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不是应该会越来越暗吗
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.59,0:46:47.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}没错啊
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.12,0:46:50.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可是为什么这么亮
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.49,0:46:52.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}实际上是在慢慢的变暗啦
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.83,0:46:54.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}因为有了适应灯的关系
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.46,0:46:56.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}才会让你觉得没有什么变化
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.00,0:46:59.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就算潜到一万公尺深的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.07,0:47:02.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}也跟在太阳下面一样哦
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.88,0:47:12.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}作战开始
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.89,0:47:23.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我快不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.29,0:47:28.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}让我休息一下
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.53,0:47:31.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真是没用耶，还游不到一个小时
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.97,0:47:34.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄，你还真是厚脸皮耶
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.60,0:47:36.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}再摸鱼的话就丢下你
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.54,0:47:39.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}要是碰到章鱼妖怪我们可不管哦
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.64,0:47:41.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}少说这种风凉话啦
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.78,0:47:45.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}说不定就在这附近呢
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.28,0:47:47.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.98,0:47:49.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}出现了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.66,0:47:54.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.92,0:47:58.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}也…也许是虎馒鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.90,0:48:00.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}而且是超大只的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.10,0:48:03.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不用你说我也知道啦
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.53,0:48:05.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}快跑啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.41,0:48:09.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}救命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.41,0:48:18.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}追…追过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.99,0:48:24.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}各位，快来这边
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.42,0:48:26.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}快点，躲到里面去
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.92,0:48:31.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆…哆啦A梦，救…救命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.10,0:48:34.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.23,0:48:36.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}别…别吃我，我一点也不好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.00,0:48:38.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.24,0:48:41.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}振作一点，大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.51,0:48:42.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}到里面去
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.91,0:48:45.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}来…来了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.85,0:48:49.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}救命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.38,0:48:51.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我找…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.85,0:48:52.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我找…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.88,0:48:53.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.82,0:48:55.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}水压炮
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.12,0:49:00.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦A梦…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.07,0:49:17.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.81,0:49:22.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.99,0:49:33.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哪里来的硬梆梆蓝色河豚啊
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.36,0:49:37.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我不是河豚，是猫…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.00,0:49:40.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好，快点给我抓起来
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.37,0:49:41.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.93,0:50:07.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}变小了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.43,0:50:08.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.86,0:50:11.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这个…不觉得很奇怪吗
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.83,0:50:12.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}什么
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.77,0:50:15.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这条虎馒鱼好像是被谁操控着
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.64,0:50:17.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你说的是指谁
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.27,0:50:19.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我怎么会知道啦
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.24,0:50:20.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}遇到这么可怕的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.71,0:50:22.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你还敢说不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.14,0:50:23.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好难受
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.84,0:50:25.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}快住手啦，胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.45,0:50:25.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.08,0:50:27.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好难受
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.05,0:50:29.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}小哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.32,0:50:30.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}公主…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.65,0:50:33.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}太好了，妳平安无事
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.29,0:50:35.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}原来是苏菲亚的朋友啊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.22,0:50:37.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}太好了，得救了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.53,0:50:38.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}小哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.53,0:50:40.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我有一种非常不好的预感
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.33,0:50:42.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你现在马上去把这件事调查清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.83,0:50:43.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.93,0:50:44.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不过
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.70,0:50:47.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我认为还是请公主您先回宫殿
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.50,0:50:49.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}跟麦地那博士谈一谈
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.40,0:50:50.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这样会比较妥当
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.14,0:50:52.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你说的没错
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.54,0:50:54.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那么就请您赶紧回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.84,0:50:55.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}而且
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.54,0:50:58.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}温迪妮陛下她也很担心您呢
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.35,0:50:59.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.45,0:51:00.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不过我跟哆啦A梦他们…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.12,0:51:01.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}妳放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.85,0:51:04.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}他们几位由我负责接送回去
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.52,0:51:06.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}总之公主请您先回宫殿去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.82,0:51:09.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我也有一种不好的预感
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.83,0:51:16.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你的名字叫小哈利对吗
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.17,0:51:17.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我是大雄，请多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.97,0:51:19.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.34,0:51:21.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你要去哪里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.84,0:51:23.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这家伙态度好差劲
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.87,0:51:25.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我要以绑架犯的罪名
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.41,0:51:27.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}逮捕你们几个
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.88,0:51:28.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}绑架
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.88,0:51:29.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你说我们
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.91,0:51:31.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}绑…绑架谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.15,0:51:34.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就是公主啊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.38,0:51:35.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}绑架苏菲亚
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.59,0:51:37.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}说什么蠢话
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.16,0:51:44.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好挤啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.63,0:51:45.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}给我带回去
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.93,0:51:47.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.34,0:52:00.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎…怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.29,0:52:09.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不要啊
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.51,0:53:08.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}麦地那博士
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.45,0:53:10.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}无论是写在这里的谜语
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.95,0:53:13.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}还是突然攻击我们的巨大虎馒鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.82,0:53:16.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我总觉得好像要发生什么大事了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.92,0:53:18.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}的确是很有意思
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.36,0:53:20.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}如果能与这张纸的主人见面
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.53,0:53:22.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}听听他的意见就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.53,0:53:24.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}小哈利应该会带他过来的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.56,0:53:25.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.70,0:53:29.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我请小哈利过来问问吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.27,0:53:33.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}他们这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.14,0:53:35.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}糟糕了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.84,0:53:37.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好难受
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.28,0:53:39.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦A梦，快想想办法
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.28,0:53:42.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不行啦，我的手伸不到口袋
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.35,0:53:45.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这群胆敢绑架我们公主的无礼家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.55,0:53:46.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}绝不能原谅他们
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.96,0:53:49.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}有…有什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.92,0:53:51.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这…这是巨齿鲨
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.06,0:53:53.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那…那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.86,0:53:54.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那是生活在
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.66,0:53:56.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}200万年前的巨型鲨鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.93,0:53:59.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}他们应该早就灭绝了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.43,0:54:00.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那…那么说
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.77,0:54:03.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我们会变成他的鱼饲料吗
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.17,0:54:04.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}鱼…鱼饲料
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.74,0:54:06.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我们肯定要被吃掉了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.11,0:54:09.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这怎么可以，快桃跑
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.44,0:54:10.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你说怎么桃啊
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.15,0:54:13.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你们两个冷静一下啦
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.35,0:54:17.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我一点也不好吃啦
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.99,0:54:19.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}小哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.29,0:54:21.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}公主
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.49,0:54:23.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}马上停止这愚蠢的举动
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.26,0:54:24.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可是，这些家伙把公主您…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.13,0:54:25.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}快点住手
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.89,0:54:28.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哈利我知道了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.30,0:54:32.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我是胖虎，我是孩子王
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.14,0:54:35.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我一点也不好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.84,0:54:36.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.14,0:54:38.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}小哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.21,0:54:42.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我一点也不好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.91,0:54:44.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我是胖虎，我是孩子王
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.65,0:54:45.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这是什么噪音啊
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.15,0:54:46.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}小哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.98,0:54:49.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}快点把哆啦A梦他们都放出来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.22,0:54:49.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.05,0:54:50.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你还不懂吗
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.15,0:54:53.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这个音波肯定是他们的悲鸣
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.16,0:54:56.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}妈…妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.53,0:54:57.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}胖虎，别唱了啦…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.86,0:55:00.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我宁可给巨齿鲨吃掉…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.30,0:55:04.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}各位，真对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.10,0:55:06.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}没事了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.47,0:55:07.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不过，我们都吓死了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.14,0:55:09.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是因为胖虎的歌声吗
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.81,0:55:11.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.11,0:55:15.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}对了，请问静香她人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.51,0:55:16.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}什么
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.35,0:55:22.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你干嘛突然大叫
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.55,0:55:24.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}说不定静香还在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.66,0:55:26.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你说的那里是…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.89,0:55:29.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是那个洞穴吗
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.73,0:55:31.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}难受啊
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.96,0:55:33.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}小哈利，我问你
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.80,0:55:35.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你该不会把静香一个人丢在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.00,0:55:37.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}自己就跑回来了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.43,0:55:39.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不，这怎么可能
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.00,0:55:43.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不好了，我们得赶紧去找静香
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.27,0:55:44.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}公主
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.74,0:55:45.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}有什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.94,0:55:48.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}温迪妮陛下请您过去找她
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.28,0:55:49.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}奶奶找我
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.48,0:55:50.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是，陛下有令
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.88,0:55:52.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}也请您把客人一起带过去
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.85,0:55:54.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}什么，我们也要过去
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.15,0:55:57.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可是静香她…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.16,0:56:00.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你们就跟苏菲亚一起去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.76,0:56:01.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}寻找静香的事
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.13,0:56:05.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就交给我跟小夫来处理
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.46,0:56:06.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}没问题的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.30,0:56:08.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我们一定可以找到静香的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.90,0:56:09.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}当然啰
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.67,0:56:12.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}也需要这位队长大人的帮忙才行
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.64,0:56:14.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.23,0:56:43.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}对不起，我先接个电话
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.80,0:56:45.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是哆啦美吗
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.81,0:56:47.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.34,0:56:49.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我又发现了一些
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.28,0:56:50.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}关于人鱼的有趣情报了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.14,0:56:52.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}现在不是闲聊的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.01,0:56:54.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}晚点再说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.25,0:56:55.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.55,0:56:58.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}挂了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.69,0:57:01.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哥哥也真是的，每次都这样
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.40,0:57:11.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}所以我就跟你说了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.00,0:57:14.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真是了不起
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.57,0:57:15.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}没想到海底
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.47,0:57:17.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}竟然有这么漂亮的城市
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.47,0:57:19.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}对啊，真让人吃惊耶
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.31,0:57:20.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好了，快走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.44,0:57:22.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}还要把你们介绍给奶奶呢
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.24,0:57:25.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}情况到底怎么样了啦，胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.28,0:57:26.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}看样子不在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.88,0:57:28.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你看…怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.75,0:57:30.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}到底该怎么办啦
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.25,0:57:34.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}静香…静香啊
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.72,0:57:37.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}他的抗压性很差吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.73,0:57:38.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.76,0:57:41.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}静香妳在哪里，妳在哪里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.63,0:57:44.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}他其实是一个好家伙啦
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.60,0:57:46.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不如我们先来看看这个吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.80,0:57:49.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这是什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.70,0:57:51.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我也不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.44,0:57:52.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不过…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.24,0:57:53.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不过什么
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.48,0:57:54.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}队长
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.64,0:57:56.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我们找到了这个
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.58,0:57:57.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.91,0:57:59.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.98,0:58:02.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你们快点把这个东西
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.38,0:58:04.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}送回麦地那博士的研究室去
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.75,0:58:06.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这些黑色液体也一起带回去
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.72,0:58:07.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.72,0:58:11.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}队长大人，到底怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.26,0:58:13.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我认为攻击大家的巨大虎馒鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.83,0:58:15.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就是受到那些坏蛋操控的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.90,0:58:17.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那些坏蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.37,0:58:18.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}而且我想
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.37,0:58:21.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}静香恐怕也是被那伙人给抓走了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.37,0:58:22.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}什么
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.27,0:58:25.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}静香
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.51,0:58:28.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你说抓走静香的那些坏蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.31,0:58:29.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}到底是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.40,0:58:48.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}奶奶
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.47,0:58:54.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那个人就是苏菲亚的…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.98,0:59:03.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦A梦，好像有点可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.21,0:59:05.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄，太没有礼貌了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.92,0:59:08.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}苏菲亚
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.72,0:59:09.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}妳迟早要继承王位
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.09,0:59:11.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}成为这个国家的女王
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.66,0:59:13.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}应该多注意自己的言行举止
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.09,0:59:15.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可是奶奶
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.43,0:59:16.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}一旦我当上了女王
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.96,0:59:19.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我就再也没有自由的时间了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.36,0:59:20.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}正因为如此
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.33,0:59:22.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我才要趁着现在了解更多的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.27,0:59:23.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}给我住嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.67,0:59:26.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}苏菲亚，妳先坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.64,0:59:27.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.57,0:59:30.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好壮观哦
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.31,0:59:31.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好漂亮哦
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.94,0:59:33.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哈利…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.44,0:59:34.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}苏菲亚
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.41,0:59:36.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我们人鱼族全体居民的未来
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.88,0:59:39.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}全都寄托在妳身上
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.25,0:59:42.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我希望国家可以永远和平
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.25,0:59:44.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}人民也能够得到幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.82,0:59:48.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这才是我们皇家后代的最大职责
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.93,0:59:50.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我把所有的希望
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.40,0:59:52.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}全都寄托在妳身上
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.13,0:59:54.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}正因为如此
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.37,0:59:57.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我不允许妳再继续任性下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.50,0:59:59.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}妳能够理解吧
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.74,1:00:00.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.91,1:00:05.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那个
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.18,1:00:08.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}虽然我不太了解，不过…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.25,1:00:11.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}要当公主还真不简单呢
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.92,1:00:15.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是啊，我到现在才知道
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.72,1:00:17.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不过，我想无论如何
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.89,1:00:18.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}苏菲亚
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.62,1:00:21.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}一定会成为一个了不起的女王
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.73,1:00:24.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}因为她是多么的帅气
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.43,1:00:26.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}也很活泼，又值得信赖
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.40,1:00:30.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}而且，还那么漂亮
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.20,1:00:31.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我能当苏菲亚的好朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.01,1:00:33.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真是太棒了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.71,1:00:37.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这个问题可不是那么简单的啦
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.14,1:00:39.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是这样吗
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.65,1:00:43.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄，谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.75,1:00:47.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就让我们当永远的好朋友吧
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.20,1:01:03.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}温迪妮陛下，我回来了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.27,1:01:06.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}咦！那静香呢
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.17,1:01:06.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.01,1:01:08.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我们没有找到
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.58,1:01:09.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}什么
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.64,1:01:12.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不过，我们找到了一个很奇怪的东西喔
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.81,1:01:14.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}还有黑色的液体
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.22,1:01:15.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}什么…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.42,1:01:18.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}看来博士的推断得到了证实
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.92,1:01:20.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是吗…那继续分析
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.16,1:01:22.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.06,1:01:25.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}一定是那些坏蛋做的好事
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.76,1:01:27.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你说的那些坏蛋他们到底是谁啦
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.06,1:01:29.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}他们就是他们嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.66,1:01:31.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}反正跟地球人又没有关系
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.97,1:01:32.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你说什么
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.87,1:01:34.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}胖虎，你冷静一点
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.87,1:01:36.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可是这个家伙从刚刚就一直…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.87,1:01:40.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}对不起，我会跟小哈利好好说的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.74,1:01:42.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这怎么好意思
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.38,1:01:43.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}小哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.45,1:01:45.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你就不能跟他们好好相处吗
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.48,1:01:47.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}他们是地球人耶
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.22,1:01:49.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}地球人自以为统治了全世界
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.95,1:01:51.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}贪得无厌的夺取地球资源
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.19,1:01:52.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}而且
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.79,1:01:55.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}还不断的污染这一片美丽的大海
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.42,1:01:57.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎么能跟他们好好的相处呢
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.69,1:02:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄他们绝不是那种人
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.13,1:02:02.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}他们是很珍惜这个地球的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.36,1:02:04.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}一定也会保护我们
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.40,1:02:08.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}无论如何我愿意相信他们
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.24,1:02:09.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你懂吗
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.21,1:02:10.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.51,1:02:12.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那个残骸
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.71,1:02:15.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不是用地球上的金属制成的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.21,1:02:16.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那个黑色液体
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.25,1:02:18.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}也不是地球上的产物
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.32,1:02:21.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}从以上的情况分析，结论是…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.32,1:02:23.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}难道说怪鱼族来到了地球
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.92,1:02:25.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}对
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.19,1:02:27.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎么会有这种事
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.06,1:02:28.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}女王陛下
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.03,1:02:31.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}妳刚才说的怪鱼族是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.53,1:02:32.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你们应该知道
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.90,1:02:35.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我们人鱼族是从蓝水星来的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.43,1:02:36.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}知道
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.37,1:02:41.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}在遥远的过去
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.47,1:02:43.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我们人鱼族和怪鱼族
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.04,1:02:47.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}在蓝水星上和平的共处
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.95,1:02:51.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可是…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.45,1:02:53.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}以海洋资源为食物的怪鱼族
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.69,1:02:56.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不断的扩张自己的势力
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.85,1:03:00.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}突然之间霸占了整个蓝水星
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.89,1:03:04.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}幸存下来的人们
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.83,1:03:07.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}桃进了深山继续战斗
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.23,1:03:09.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}但是面对敌人压倒性的力量
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.70,1:03:11.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}还是无能为力
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.64,1:03:15.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}迫不得已我们桃离了蓝水星
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.47,1:03:18.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}经过漫长的太空旅行，终于…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.98,1:03:20.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}来到了地球上
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.78,1:03:26.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这么说静香真的被抓走了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.72,1:03:28.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}恐怕只能这么想了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.66,1:03:39.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}快说，人鱼之剑在什么地方
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.90,1:03:41.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你在说什么
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.20,1:03:42.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}少装傻
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.54,1:03:48.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}一定是被你们人鱼族给藏起来了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.54,1:03:50.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我真的不知道啊
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.08,1:03:55.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}人鱼族的公主竟然说不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.62,1:03:58.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}公主，我才不是公主
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.39,1:04:01.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}妳头上的那个皇冠
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.02,1:04:03.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就是皇家的证明
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.22,1:04:07.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}苏菲亚，妳的皇冠呢
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.26,1:04:09.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}到哪里去了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.23,1:04:11.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我借给静香了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.17,1:04:13.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这么说静香她…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.13,1:04:15.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.50,1:04:16.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.60,1:04:19.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那个皇冠是我们皇家的标志
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.94,1:04:21.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大概是把她误认为苏菲亚
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.91,1:04:23.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}才把她抓走的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.41,1:04:24.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}什么…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.31,1:04:28.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦A梦，我们要赶紧去救静香
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.55,1:04:30.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可是
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.35,1:04:33.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那个怪鱼族为什么要抓苏菲亚呢
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.89,1:04:35.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}依我的推测看来
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.82,1:04:38.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}答案就藏在这里面
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.79,1:04:40.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}对啊
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.59,1:04:41.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怪鱼族他们
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.43,1:04:43.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就是为了想要得到人鱼之剑
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.17,1:04:47.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好痛啊
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.77,1:04:50.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这个家伙，你还敢做坏事
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.91,1:04:51.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}放手
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.67,1:04:52.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你这是干什么
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.77,1:04:53.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你们这些地球人
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.81,1:04:56.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎么会知道人鱼之剑的事情
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.18,1:04:58.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}苏菲亚，是妳吗
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.58,1:04:59.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}奶奶
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.58,1:05:01.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}他们只是想要帮助我们
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.28,1:05:04.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}来寻找传说的那把人鱼之剑的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.95,1:05:07.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不好意思，博士，那个…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.96,1:05:10.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}对不起，失培一下
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.93,1:05:13.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.26,1:05:16.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.97,1:05:21.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大家好，我是哆啦美
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.34,1:05:24.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这下子又冒出个黄色河豚来了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.14,1:05:26.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这个小刺鲀是谁啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.14,1:05:27.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.14,1:05:29.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真是没礼貌
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.51,1:05:30.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}算了啦
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.71,1:05:32.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}妳怎么从口袋跑来
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.62,1:05:33.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}对了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.72,1:05:36.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哥哥，你又忘了带备用口袋啰
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.66,1:05:40.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}妳是通过口袋过来的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.96,1:05:42.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我很聪明吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.69,1:05:44.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那妳来这里做什么
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.73,1:05:46.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哥哥，你老是…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.66,1:05:49.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真有意思，真是太有意思了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.27,1:05:51.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那个…博士
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.23,1:05:53.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}能不能让我见识一下那个口袋
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.74,1:05:56.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}请看这个啦
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.25,1:06:11.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}静香
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.26,1:06:15.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}原来公主的名字叫静香啊
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.96,1:06:19.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}看起来就是坏蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.46,1:06:22.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就是你这个坏家伙绑架了静香吗
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.30,1:06:23.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}马上把她送回来
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.94,1:06:24.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}现在就给我还来
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.97,1:06:25.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.00,1:06:29.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我就是怪鱼族之王布依金
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.81,1:06:32.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你们的公主就在我的手里
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.91,1:06:33.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}其实她…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.15,1:06:34.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}苏菲亚
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.88,1:06:36.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}快把宝剑交出来
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.68,1:06:39.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}马上把人鱼之剑交给我
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.72,1:06:41.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不然的话…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.19,1:06:47.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}静香
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.33,1:06:51.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可恶，你搞什么鬼
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.46,1:06:52.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好难受
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.87,1:06:58.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这是免费奉送的，也尝尝这个吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.11,1:07:02.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}想要救公主的命
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.71,1:07:04.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就乖乖的把宝剑交出来
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.71,1:07:05.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}知道了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.92,1:07:13.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不行啦，为什么是公主您…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.49,1:07:14.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不要阻止我
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.02,1:07:16.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}只要跟怪鱼族宣告
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.56,1:07:18.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我才是真正的公主
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.29,1:07:20.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那么静香就可以被放出来了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.29,1:07:23.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}谁要是反对就回去
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.76,1:07:25.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可是…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.13,1:07:28.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}公主
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.63,1:07:29.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.60,1:07:33.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}当得到皇家真心祈祷之时
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.37,1:07:35.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}五色之光将会聚集
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.88,1:07:38.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}而愿望也得以实现
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.65,1:07:44.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}所谓的五色之光指的是什么呢
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.96,1:07:54.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}如果不带着人鱼之剑去
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.90,1:07:57.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}恐怕是没有办法的
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.20,1:07:59.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}什么，人鱼之剑是什么东西
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.93,1:08:01.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}让你们久等了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.50,1:08:03.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}宝剑怎么了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.40,1:08:04.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}苏菲亚
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.34,1:08:07.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}人鱼之剑到底长什么样子
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.21,1:08:09.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}谁也没有亲眼看过
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.28,1:08:11.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不过据说是像珍珠一样
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.51,1:08:13.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}闪耀着光芒的宝剑
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.55,1:08:15.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那就是这个了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.02,1:08:18.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}速成珍珠贝
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.25,1:08:20.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这的确是能够做出珍珠来
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.35,1:08:22.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不过我们想要的是剑啊
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.79,1:08:25.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就是说嘛，不是剑的话就没用啦
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.70,1:08:32.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那么…要是把这个变成珍珠呢
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.23,1:08:33.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那种东西怎么可能
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.67,1:08:35.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这种假货一眼就看穿了啦
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.57,1:08:37.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不，这也许是个好主意哦
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.74,1:08:40.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是啊，不是说谁也没看过吗
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.21,1:08:43.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}说的也是
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.05,1:08:46.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好，那个借我一下
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.06,1:08:54.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.29,1:08:59.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.70,1:09:02.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好，放进去啰
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.40,1:09:07.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦美
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.84,1:09:09.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大家快桃
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.41,1:09:11.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}快点
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.32,1:09:29.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你叫我们快桃，就是因为这个
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.64,1:09:40.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好了，大功告成
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.94,1:09:42.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄，干得好耶
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.97,1:09:45.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}想不到大雄真有两把刷子
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.94,1:09:50.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好了，我们大家一起去救静香吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.48,1:09:53.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好了，苏菲亚
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.79,1:09:55.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}接下来就交给我们吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.72,1:09:57.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}请你借一艘潜水艇给我们
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.06,1:10:00.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不，我也要一起去
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.16,1:10:01.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}苏菲亚
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.96,1:10:03.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}妳将来还要领导这个国家
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.86,1:10:05.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}领导你们人鱼族
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.46,1:10:06.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}绝对不能够乱来
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.03,1:10:09.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}如果连静香一个人都保护不了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.27,1:10:11.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那么我又怎么保护这个国家呢
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.50,1:10:13.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}现在就是该冒点风险才是
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.94,1:10:15.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好了，都不要再说了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.44,1:10:17.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}快去救我们的朋友吧
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.01,1:10:19.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}了不起
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.85,1:10:22.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}痛死了，不过确实了不起
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.21,1:10:23.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这算什么
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.12,1:10:27.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}公主
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.45,1:10:29.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}小哈利，你又要来阻止我吗
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.59,1:10:31.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不是的，我有个请求
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.66,1:10:33.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}请让我跟你们一起去
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.43,1:10:35.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我小哈利为了保护公主
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.36,1:10:37.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就算赴汤蹈火也在所不辞
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.00,1:10:39.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你又在逞强了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.30,1:10:42.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}一个人努力
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.50,1:10:44.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}的确是一件非常值得肯定的事情
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.10,1:10:47.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不过与其自己单打独斗
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.31,1:10:50.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}还不如大家一起同心协力比较好
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.51,1:10:51.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}没错
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.38,1:10:51.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.11,1:10:54.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我们大家都是伙伴，一起努力吧
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.05,1:10:56.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}一起加油吧
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.35,1:10:59.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}虽然你是一个让人讨厌的小刺鲀
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.82,1:11:02.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}但是你不在就没有人跟我吵架了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.22,1:11:04.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那多没意思啊
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.16,1:11:06.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}请多多指教哦
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.79,1:11:08.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}公主
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.23,1:11:11.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}全都要靠你了，小小队长大人
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.07,1:11:14.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.53,1:11:17.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好，出发啰
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.18,1:11:28.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}由大雄跟哆啦A梦担任先锋队
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.85,1:11:31.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}其他人就留在这里待命
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.72,1:11:36.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄，你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.49,1:11:39.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}胸口闷闷的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.19,1:11:42.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}而且还觉得有一点头晕
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.40,1:11:44.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这么说起来我好像也…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.67,1:11:47.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我从刚才就已经…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.60,1:11:49.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真奇怪
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.57,1:11:51.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不好了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.54,1:11:52.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.77,1:11:55.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是适应灯的效果正在慢慢的消失
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.71,1:11:58.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}什么
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.48,1:12:01.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦美，胖虎跟小夫就拜托妳了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.72,1:12:06.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哥哥，静香有危险
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.32,1:12:08.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}只剩下30分钟了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.72,1:12:10.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不会吧
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.89,1:12:11.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好难受
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.16,1:12:13.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}静香公主
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.16,1:12:17.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄，哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.87,1:12:20.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}公主，我们来接妳了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.60,1:12:22.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎么都是一些小孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.57,1:12:24.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}瞧不起人吗
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.37,1:12:26.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}布依金在哪里
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.78,1:12:28.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}对付你们这些人
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.18,1:12:30.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我托拉吉斯就绰绰有余了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.68,1:12:33.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}废话少说，人鱼之剑带来了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.35,1:12:35.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就装在这个里面
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.18,1:12:36.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好，拿过来
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.45,1:12:39.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不行，要用公主来交换
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.86,1:12:42.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}太麻烦了，干脆动手吧
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.33,1:12:44.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}等宝剑到手以后再说
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.36,1:12:45.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦美，还有多少时间
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.93,1:12:46.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我看看
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.93,1:12:49.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}糟了，只剩下4分钟了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.23,1:12:52.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}时间不够了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.47,1:12:55.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可是在这种情况下也不能出手啊
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.54,1:12:56.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}静香
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.04,1:12:59.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}从这些文字上分析
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.28,1:13:00.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}人鱼之剑的秘密
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.01,1:13:03.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}似乎与公主有很深的关连
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.85,1:13:06.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}原本宝剑还有盔甲
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.32,1:13:07.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}以及公主的皇冠
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.92,1:13:11.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}在5千年前就是某人的宝物
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.19,1:13:12.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}沙卡那，下一页
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.06,1:13:14.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是的
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.69,1:13:16.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}只要将这三样宝物凑齐
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.83,1:13:18.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就会产生巨大的力量
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.06,1:13:21.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}足以控制了整个世界
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.30,1:13:25.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}而掌握这一切关键的人正是公主
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.40,1:13:26.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}苏菲亚她…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.74,1:13:31.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.84,1:13:34.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就在那里进行交换，去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.18,1:13:37.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那边的蓝色河豚
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.65,1:13:38.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我才不是…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.85,1:13:39.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}把剑拿过来
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.82,1:13:41.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}什么河豚呢
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.26,1:13:48.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}还剩两分钟
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.63,1:13:50.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}快啊…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.87,1:13:55.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}为什么停住了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.10,1:13:58.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}先让我看看那把宝剑
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.27,1:13:59.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}先把公主放了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.84,1:14:01.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我要先看宝剑
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.27,1:14:02.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}还剩1分半
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.74,1:14:04.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你想反抗我吗，该死的蓝色河豚
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.04,1:14:06.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我是猫
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.71,1:14:09.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不好了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.32,1:14:10.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}静香
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.15,1:14:12.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}还剩1分钟
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.82,1:14:13.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哥哥
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.72,1:14:15.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不好了，不好了啦
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.49,1:14:19.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.19,1:14:20.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你们看好了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.33,1:14:22.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那就是…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.17,1:14:27.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那么，把静香…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.77,1:14:29.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}快点把公主放出来
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.17,1:14:32.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}还剩30秒
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.91,1:14:34.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好，公主还给你
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.18,1:14:40.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}静香
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.78,1:14:43.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}还剩20秒
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.43,1:14:54.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}还剩12秒
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.03,1:14:56.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄，拿好这个
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.50,1:14:59.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}看我的
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.63,1:15:01.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}静香
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.97,1:15:03.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}快用适应灯
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.94,1:15:09.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}已经可以了啦
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.21,1:15:12.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}静香
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.48,1:15:14.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄，哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.02,1:15:15.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.15,1:15:18.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}太好了…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.50,1:15:29.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真的好险哦
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.80,1:15:31.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那些家伙该怎么处理呢
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.57,1:15:33.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}只要宝剑到手他们就没用了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.97,1:15:35.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}随便你们吧
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.47,1:15:36.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.91,1:15:38.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎么样，静香，妳还好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.54,1:15:39.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}有受伤吗
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.84,1:15:40.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我没事
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.01,1:15:43.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄，哆啦A梦，谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.28,1:15:45.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.65,1:15:46.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.88,1:15:49.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}射击…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.29,1:15:51.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}危险
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.89,1:15:56.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.36,1:15:58.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.23,1:15:58.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}到这边来
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.06,1:16:00.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}快点…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.43,1:16:01.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.03,1:16:04.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.14,1:16:09.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不快点去救他的话
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.01,1:16:15.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好耶
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.85,1:16:17.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}太慢了啦
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.39,1:16:24.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}静香，趁现在
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.59,1:16:25.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.86,1:16:26.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可是…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.89,1:16:28.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}快点走啊，静香
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.93,1:16:31.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}看我的厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.04,1:16:45.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我生气了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.45,1:16:54.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那个臭小子，就像在跳舞呢
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.32,1:16:55.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}继续跳啊
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.82,1:16:56.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.82,1:16:57.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}没事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.19,1:17:02.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}水压炮
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.13,1:17:05.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}没用的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.60,1:17:10.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哥哥，闪远一点
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.94,1:17:11.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那家伙想要干嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.04,1:17:13.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}射击…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.71,1:17:17.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}避敌斗篷
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.05,1:17:23.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}太棒了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.82,1:17:25.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦美好厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.35,1:17:27.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那不是…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.26,1:17:34.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.63,1:17:44.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哥…哥哥
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.84,1:17:49.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}快点跑啊
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.18,1:17:57.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这就是人鱼之剑
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.25,1:18:00.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你这个笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.12,1:18:03.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}竟敢拿这种假货来敷衍我
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.92,1:18:05.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}实在是对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.83,1:18:08.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}听好了，传说中…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.23,1:18:11.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}人鱼之剑上面和那个盔甲一样
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.30,1:18:13.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}都有镶着红宝石
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.47,1:18:20.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}当年
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.67,1:18:23.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我们的祖先在侵略人鱼族之时
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.41,1:18:25.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}出现了一位身穿盔甲
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.48,1:18:27.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}手持人鱼之剑的战士
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.58,1:18:29.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}起身对抗我们怪鱼族
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.15,1:18:33.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那个战士身上穿的东西还有一件
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.05,1:18:36.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就是公主的皇冠
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.99,1:18:39.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}根据古代文献的记载
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.56,1:18:41.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}皇冠，盔甲，还有人鱼之剑
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.06,1:18:43.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}只要拥有这三样宝物
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.93,1:18:45.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就会成为人鱼族的神
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.60,1:18:49.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}也就是玛娜提娅所选出来的战士
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.40,1:18:52.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}被选为神的战士
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.27,1:18:54.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}最终将成为人鱼族的领袖
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.08,1:18:58.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}带领人鱼族的人民对抗怪鱼族
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.65,1:19:05.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}而那位战士的名字就叫做苏菲亚
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.36,1:19:10.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}一样的名字耶
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.16,1:19:14.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}接下来又会怎么样
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.73,1:19:16.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}最后因为寡不敌众
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.73,1:19:19.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}人鱼族渐渐被逼到走投无路
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.14,1:19:23.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}终于有一天不得不离开蓝水星
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.81,1:19:26.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}在这同时盔甲被怪鱼族夺走
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.01,1:19:30.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}而人鱼之剑也下落不明
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.48,1:19:33.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}现在我们人鱼族只剩下一样东西
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.88,1:19:36.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就是公主头上的那顶皇冠
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.89,1:19:40.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}而且能够引出皇冠力量的人
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.72,1:19:43.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就是拥有相同名字的公主
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.17,1:19:50.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}根据传说
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.57,1:19:53.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}战士身上所穿的盔甲和宝剑
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.70,1:19:56.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}会自动应答主人的召唤
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.34,1:19:57.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}托拉吉斯
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.17,1:19:57.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}小的在
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.94,1:20:00.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}宝剑就在这附近
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.68,1:20:01.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}听好了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.81,1:20:04.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这一次一定要把人鱼族给消灭掉
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.38,1:20:05.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是，遵命
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.52,1:20:08.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}而且一定要把人鱼之剑弄到手
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.02,1:20:11.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}快去，发动总攻击
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.66,1:20:12.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}遵命
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.57,1:20:31.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}陛下，怪鱼族开始进攻了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.51,1:20:34.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}没办法了，立刻准备反击
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.35,1:20:35.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.51,1:20:37.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}小哈利，我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.28,1:20:38.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是，公主
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.65,1:20:39.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}苏菲亚
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.65,1:20:40.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.52,1:20:42.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就全权托付给妳处理了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.66,1:20:46.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}妳自己来做最正确的判断吧
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.62,1:20:48.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}奶奶
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.29,1:20:49.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这场战争会是什么结果
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.13,1:20:51.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我也无法预料
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.56,1:20:54.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}但一定是一场严苛的战斗
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.33,1:20:55.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}如此重责大任
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.97,1:20:59.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}现在却要由妳一个人来承担
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.14,1:21:02.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}请妳原谅奶奶
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.77,1:21:06.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}奶奶以前对妳总是太过严厉了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.01,1:21:10.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}但是，请妳千万不要忘记
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.92,1:21:14.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}奶奶比任何人都爱妳
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.49,1:21:17.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}奶奶
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.82,1:21:21.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我也一样，我也是最爱奶奶了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.53,1:21:23.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}苏菲亚
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.10,1:21:31.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哥哥，我也最喜欢你了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.50,1:21:33.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我也一样，哆啦美
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.77,1:21:36.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我开玩笑的啦
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.88,1:21:39.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好，我们一定要打败怪鱼族
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.66,1:21:50.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}射击…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.96,1:21:53.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}避敌…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.56,1:21:58.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真是的
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.17,1:22:01.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}臭小子
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.97,1:22:06.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}刚才竟然敢让我丢人现眼
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.57,1:22:07.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我刺
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.74,1:22:09.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}看招
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.04,1:22:11.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哈利…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.29,1:22:18.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真是的
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.89,1:22:23.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}撤退，快点撤退啊
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.69,1:22:27.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}邪恶之心会使剑变得污浊
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.36,1:22:29.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}善良之心会使剑变得清澈
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.10,1:22:33.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这是刻在皇冠上的另一个谜语
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.20,1:22:34.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我相信公主
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.54,1:22:37.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}您一定有办法解开这个谜语的
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.94,1:22:38.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}报告情况
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.04,1:22:40.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我方损害非常巨大
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.68,1:22:42.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}目前战斗力已经减半
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.04,1:22:44.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那么，先暂时撤退吧
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.91,1:22:46.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可是公主…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.98,1:22:49.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我们的神，玛娜提娅啊
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.72,1:22:52.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}请聆听我的祈祷
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.25,1:22:54.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不能再让那些无辜的士兵们受伤了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.12,1:22:57.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}无论如何，请您保护他们吧
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.66,1:23:04.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}当得到皇家真心祈祷之时
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.07,1:23:09.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}五色之光将会聚集
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.17,1:23:12.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}而愿望也得以实现
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.35,1:23:24.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那就是人鱼之剑
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.79,1:23:26.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}一点也没错
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.26,1:23:29.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}传说现在变成事实了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.81,1:23:43.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那把剑是…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.31,1:23:50.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这就是人鱼之剑吗
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.35,1:23:51.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那是布依金
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.58,1:23:52.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}布依金
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.42,1:23:53.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那把人鱼之剑
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.42,1:23:54.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不是你可以使用的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.02,1:23:58.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}终于…终于落在我的手里了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.92,1:24:00.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}看招
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.73,1:24:05.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.16,1:24:08.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}救命啊
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.27,1:24:13.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}看着，这就是传说之剑的威力
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.01,1:24:18.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.28,1:24:19.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那是…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.85,1:24:23.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不…不好了，大家快点桃命啊
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.19,1:24:31.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}胆敢反抗我的人绝不饶恕
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.42,1:24:33.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那个怪物是怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.79,1:24:37.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.90,1:24:40.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}本大爷
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.90,1:24:44.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}即将成为全宇宙的主宰者了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.64,1:24:49.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这里是…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.74,1:24:53.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}原来是用防水绳索建造的基地
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.78,1:24:58.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}看我的，钓鱼手套豪华版
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.25,1:24:59.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}妈啊
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.22,1:25:00.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大家一定要撑下去
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.85,1:25:03.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好，上钩了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.06,1:25:07.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}把人鱼族的军队通通赶尽杀绝
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.47,1:25:13.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}太可怕了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.60,1:25:16.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那把剑的威力是无法预测的强大
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.74,1:25:18.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这样下去，恐怕大家…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.97,1:25:22.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}神啊，保护我们人鱼族吧
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.05,1:25:34.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}一切都要结束了吗，是真的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.29,1:25:35.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}苏菲亚
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.66,1:25:37.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}一定要想办法把宝剑夺回来
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.19,1:25:41.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大家同心协力才走到这一步
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.20,1:25:43.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}绝不能轻言放弃
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.43,1:25:44.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.93,1:25:46.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}对吧
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.67,1:25:49.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}对，没错
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.41,1:26:01.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦A梦，接下来该怎么办呢
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.15,1:26:03.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哥哥
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.62,1:26:06.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}能不能把布依金叫到这里来呢
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.49,1:26:07.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}什么…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.69,1:26:08.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}有道理耶
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.82,1:26:09.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}没有水
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.59,1:26:11.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}人鱼之剑也就没有办法使用了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.06,1:26:14.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可是这么狭小的地方不可能吧
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.96,1:26:18.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}有了，就用虚构海水连带气体…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.50,1:26:20.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}一次就拿出来了耶
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.47,1:26:21.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你打算怎么用呢
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.07,1:26:24.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}只要朝布依金喷一下就行了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.17,1:26:24.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可是
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.81,1:26:27.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}想用这个道具得先用虚构水
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.18,1:26:29.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}水泵的开关一直都是开着的
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.58,1:26:31.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}什么，真的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.18,1:26:32.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}没错
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.18,1:26:34.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}既然这样的话，我去拿过来
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.75,1:26:36.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不过，哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.85,1:26:39.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}要怎么把气体喷到布依金身上
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.29,1:26:41.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我有一个很好的办法
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.66,1:26:43.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就用这个
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.19,1:26:45.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这又是什么秘密道具
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.86,1:26:47.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就是普通的冲浪板
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.36,1:26:48.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}唉呦
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.87,1:26:51.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}冲啊
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.24,1:26:53.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}找到他了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.97,1:26:59.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}看我的厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.38,1:27:02.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}赏你一个屁
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.41,1:27:04.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可恶
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.76,1:27:15.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大家快点去那座小岛
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.43,1:27:16.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好的
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.67,1:27:25.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不…不好了，苏…苏菲亚
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.44,1:27:30.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}苏菲亚，快点，往这边跑
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.48,1:27:39.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦美呢
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.68,1:27:40.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}她还没到
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.82,1:27:43.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}在这之前…带上这个
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.42,1:27:45.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这是什么东西
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.39,1:27:48.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这是虚构海水触觉眼镜啊
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.57,1:27:55.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你们这些家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.40,1:27:57.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}到此为止了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.34,1:28:00.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}布依金，快投降吧
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.14,1:28:03.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}自以为聪明的地球人
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.24,1:28:05.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你们就当公主的培葬吧
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.84,1:28:07.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我可不允许
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.45,1:28:12.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}经过了5千年的漫长等待
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.38,1:28:14.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}终于能够消灭人鱼族了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.95,1:28:17.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}去死吧
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.33,1:28:26.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这…这是为什么
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.83,1:28:28.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}成功了…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.64,1:28:30.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}因为那是虚构水啊
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.50,1:28:32.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你说什么
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.54,1:28:36.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}竟然有这种蠢事
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.64,1:28:37.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}只要不是真正的水
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.04,1:28:40.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那把人鱼之剑就无法使用了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.68,1:28:43.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那把神圣的剑你根本就不配使用
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.95,1:28:46.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好了，快把人鱼之剑还给我们
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.19,1:28:48.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}谁敢妨碍本大爷
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.69,1:28:50.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我就让他粉身碎骨
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.76,1:28:54.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}苏菲亚
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.53,1:28:57.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这个小妞
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.87,1:29:03.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}苏菲亚公主
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.84,1:29:04.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}站住
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.34,1:29:07.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}人鱼族啊
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.01,1:29:09.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}竟敢单独跟我对抗
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.14,1:29:12.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}算妳勇气可嘉
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.21,1:29:13.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}但也到此为止
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.81,1:29:15.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}只要有了这把剑
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.42,1:29:18.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}本大爷注定是要统治全宇宙的\N哥哥！走开
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.79,1:29:21.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}去死吧
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.92,1:29:22.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}找到了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.63,1:29:26.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}秘剑电光丸
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.90,1:29:33.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}虚构水面
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.17,1:29:35.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}仿真器水泵
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.87,1:29:37.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那是什么东西
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.44,1:29:39.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大家快点往上飞
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.31,1:29:41.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦美，把开关关掉
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.57,1:30:04.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}放我出去…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.70,1:30:08.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}拜托，把我从这里放出去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.07,1:30:11.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}乖乖投降吧
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.91,1:30:13.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你们的国王布依金
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.78,1:30:15.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}已经被我们俘虏了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.74,1:30:16.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}胡说
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.15,1:30:18.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}赶快投降吧
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.45,1:30:20.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可恶
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.38,1:30:22.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我们怎么可能会输给人鱼族
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.02,1:30:25.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我们是无敌的
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.27,1:30:42.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.22,1:30:55.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.09,1:30:59.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大海
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.04,1:31:22.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好厉害，好厉害哦
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.48,1:31:23.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}太棒了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.42,1:31:23.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好漂亮
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.08,1:31:25.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真的耶
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.79,1:31:34.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.63,1:31:38.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}因为大海实在是太美了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.53,1:31:41.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}太美了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.67,1:31:43.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}苏菲亚
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.47,1:31:45.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我想这应该才是人鱼之剑
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.74,1:31:47.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真正的力量对不对
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.87,1:31:48.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}对啊
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.08,1:31:50.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}总有一天
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.24,1:31:51.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我们一定会带着这把剑
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.84,1:31:54.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}回到故乡蓝水星去的
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.35,1:31:59.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}但那里因为怪鱼族的污染
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.29,1:32:01.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}现在是一个只有污水的星球啊
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.65,1:32:04.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可是无论如何那也是我们的故乡
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.93,1:32:07.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}绝不能轻言放弃
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.96,1:32:09.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这不是大雄这一次
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.60,1:32:11.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}让我们了解的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.23,1:32:14.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我要使用这把剑
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.60,1:32:16.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}让受到污染的海水变回清澈
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.74,1:32:19.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}使蓝水星恢复美丽的容貌
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.61,1:32:24.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}这是我们人鱼族被赋予的使命啊
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.65,1:32:27.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}没错吧，小哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.62,1:32:30.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是的，公主
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.85,1:32:33.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}能够让我遇到你们真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.32,1:32:38.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.07,1:32:54.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好难受
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.98,1:32:56.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}快…快想办法
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.31,1:32:57.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}没办法
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.99,1:33:11.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}公主又更加成长了，真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.53,1:33:15.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是啊，看来该让她继承王位了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.03,1:33:19.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.97,1:33:23.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}光荣属于…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.37,1:33:27.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}苏菲亚女王
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.58,1:33:31.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎么了，静香
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.25,1:33:32.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}昨天晚上我没有回家
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.08,1:33:34.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}会被妈妈骂死的
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.12,1:33:36.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}糟糕了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.52,1:33:39.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎么办啦
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.02,1:33:43.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那么是最好能够回到昨天吧
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.33,1:33:44.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}对不对
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.36,1:33:46.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就是这么回事
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.03,1:33:48.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.50,1:33:50.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}太危险了，大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.27,1:33:51.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.90,1:33:54.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不晓得能不能再见到苏菲亚
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.67,1:33:58.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不过，只有这点我敢保证
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.88,1:34:00.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}苏菲亚他们的传说
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.48,1:34:02.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}以后还是会继续流传下去的
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.81,1:34:03.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}一定会
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.05,1:34:07.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}苏菲亚真的好可爱耶
Dialogue: 0,1:34:11.22,1:34:12.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}怎么会这样
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.32,1:34:14.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}静香，对不起啦
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.10,1:34:19.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.03,1:34:21.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}他去打棒球了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.50,1:34:22.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真是的
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.53,1:34:25.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}爸爸，去帮我买点东西
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.30,1:34:26.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哆啦美，拜托妳了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.20,1:34:29.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}爸爸，最近你老是这样
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.94,1:34:33.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}两块油豆腐，四块竹荚鱼干
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.21,1:34:36.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}培根，鸡蛋，还有爸爸的啤酒
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.61,1:34:38.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}还有哆啦美的菠萝面包
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.88,1:34:40.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我最喜欢妈妈了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.75,1:34:44.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好，我来…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.23,1:34:48.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.99,1:34:50.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2}臭大雄，你在干什么啦
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.50,1:34:58.67,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}电影片尾曲「就这样吧」
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.00,1:35:02.67,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}回忆走过的每一天
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.77,1:35:05.31,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}刻划着时间最美的时候
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.48,1:35:07.21,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}有你的笑容陪伴着
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.38,1:35:10.22,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}我一个人也不寂寞
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.42,1:35:14.35,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}世界的两端作同一个梦
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.52,1:35:17.42,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}持续着我们约定的承诺
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.59,1:35:19.36,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}期待重逢能牵着手
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.53,1:35:22.46,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}穿越那美丽的时空
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.96,1:35:26.57,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}别害怕我会陪伴着你
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.73,1:35:30.84,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}找寻那世界每个幸福的入口
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.00,1:35:34.67,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}面对困难准备好出发
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.84,1:35:37.21,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}手牵手飞吧
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.38,1:35:40.28,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}就这样吧　就这样吧
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.45,1:35:43.32,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}一起向未来出发
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.48,1:35:45.69,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}找寻期待的想象
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.85,1:35:49.32,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}勇敢追梦吧　努力吧
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.49,1:35:52.43,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}就这样吧　就这样吧
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.59,1:35:55.46,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}我们会很不一样
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.63,1:35:59.07,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}飞向那世界的尽头
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.23,1:36:03.27,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}找我们的信仰
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.25,1:36:15.15,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}回忆拥抱的每一天
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.32,1:36:18.19,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}刻划着彼此最美的时刻
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.35,1:36:20.19,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}有你的手心温暖着
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.35,1:36:23.16,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}我永远也不会寂寞
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.39,1:36:27.23,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}世界的两端永恒的美梦
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.40,1:36:30.27,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}闪耀着我们不灭的承诺
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.43,1:36:32.30,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}只要肩并肩一起走
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.47,1:36:35.27,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}穿越那浩瀚的星空
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.44,1:36:39.51,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}别害怕我会陪伴着你
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.67,1:36:43.85,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}找寻这世界幸福的入口
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.01,1:36:47.58,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}面对困难准备好出发
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.75,1:36:50.05,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}手牵手飞吧
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.22,1:36:53.22,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}就这样吧　就这样吧
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.39,1:36:56.19,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}一起向未来出发
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.29,1:36:58.59,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}找寻期待的想象
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.76,1:37:02.26,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}勇敢追梦吧　努力吧
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.43,1:37:05.27,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}就这样吧　就这样吧
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.43,1:37:08.30,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}我们会很不一样
Dialogue: 0,1:37:08.47,1:37:11.91,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}飞向那世界的尽头
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.07,1:37:14.24,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}找我们的信仰
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.41,1:37:17.15,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}不管前方多难以想象
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.31,1:37:20.28,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}遍体鳞伤也要勇敢前往
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.45,1:37:22.89,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}只要握紧彼此的手
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.05,1:37:26.26,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}多少困难都会度过
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.42,1:37:29.33,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}尽管时间剩下一秒钟
Dialogue: 0,1:37:29.49,1:37:32.36,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}也一定尽全力不会放手
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.53,1:37:36.17,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}等待雨过天晴之后
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.33,1:37:38.77,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}拥抱的感动
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.94,1:37:43.17,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}那就这样吧一起向未来出发
